usage: shard.py [-h] [--shots [SHOTS ...]] [--shot-list SHOT_LIST]
                [--include-raster] [--condition-on-guard-failure]
                [--max-slices MAX_SLICES] [--prepare-only]
                [--enumerate-corpus] [--manifest MANIFEST]
                [--cohort-report COHORT_REPORT] [--write-shards WRITE_SHARDS]
                [--shard-count SHARD_COUNT] [--tranche-shards TRANCHE_SHARDS]
                [--plan-output PLAN_OUTPUT]
                [output_root]

Write forward-solve steering sessions for one shard of MAST shots.

positional arguments:
  output_root

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --shots [SHOTS ...]
  --shot-list SHOT_LIST
  --include-raster
  --condition-on-guard-failure
  --max-slices MAX_SLICES
  --prepare-only
  --enumerate-corpus
  --manifest MANIFEST
  --cohort-report COHORT_REPORT
  --write-shards WRITE_SHARDS
  --shard-count SHARD_COUNT
  --tranche-shards TRANCHE_SHARDS
  --plan-output PLAN_OUTPUT
